---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const lastUpdated = "23 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Employment Compliance Disclaimer"
  description="ashmo.io is a personal, independent, educational platform. It does not represent any employer, client, or affiliated business."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Employment"
    highlight="Disclaimer."
    description={`The platform is personal, independent, and educational. Last updated: ${lastUpdated}.`}
    primary={{ href: '/confidentiality/', label: 'Confidentiality policy' }}
    secondary={{ href: '/legal/', label: 'All legal pages' }}
    stats={[
      { value: 'Personal', label: 'platform' },
      { value: 'Independent', label: 'views' },
      { value: 'UAE', label: 'labour law' },
    ]}
    sideEyebrow="Independence"
    sideTitle="Personal views. No employer endorsement. No confidential information."
    sideDescription="Sets out the independence of ashmo.io, its relationship to employment and confidentiality obligations, and the user's expected reading of the content."
  />

  <section class="section-shell pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] space-y-4">
      

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">01 · Independent Personal Platform</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Independent Personal Platform</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>ashmo.io is a personal, independent, educational platform owned and operated by Ashraf Hassan. It is not the website of any employer, client, or affiliated company.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">02 · Personal Views Only</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Personal Views Only</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>All articles, opinions, recommendations, frameworks, and case studies represent the personal views of Ashraf Hassan based on general industry knowledge, public information, and personal experience. They do not represent the views of any current or former employer, client, partner, or affiliated business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">03 · No Disclosure of Employer Information</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">No Disclosure of Employer Information</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>No confidential employer information is intentionally disclosed. No internal documents, systems, data, strategies, pricing, unpublished campaigns, customer information, vendor terms, or business secrets are shared. Where examples are required, they are generalised or anonymised. See the <a href="/confidentiality/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Confidentiality Policy</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">04 · No Use of Employer Materials</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">No Use of Employer Materials</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>The platform does not use, republish, adapt, or reference employer-owned materials, brand assets, templates, dashboards, files, screenshots, copy, design systems, or internal tools without written permission.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">05 · No Competition with Employer</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">No Competition with Employer</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>The platform is designed to remain educational and advisory in nature, and does not compete with any employer's business unless and until that activity has been separately reviewed and approved in writing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">06 · Compliance with Employment Obligations</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Compliance with Employment Obligations</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Ashraf Hassan operates this platform in good-faith compliance with applicable employment contracts, confidentiality and non-disclosure obligations, non-compete or non-solicitation clauses (where applicable), and the requirements of UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 33 of 2021 on the Regulation of Labour Relations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">07 · No Endorsement</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">No Endorsement</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Users should not assume any endorsement, approval, affiliation, sponsorship, or partnership with any current or former employer, client, or partner, unless that affiliation is explicitly disclosed on the relevant page.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">08 · Reporting Concerns</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Reporting Concerns</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>If you are a current or former employer, partner, or third party and have any concern about content on this site, please contact <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a>. Concerns will be reviewed promptly and acted on in good faith.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
